OL,3,GNEWSAShoppers warned to stay vigilant
OL,4,Aon Black Friday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has warned shoppers to
OL,7,Fstay vigilant of scams when looking for
OL,8,Fa bargain on Black Friday.
OL,10,FWayne Snowden, of Devon and Cornwall
OL,11,FPolice's fraud team, said the week
OL,12,Fleading up to Black Friday and Cyber
OL,13,FMonday was the "busiest week for any
OL,14,Fonline fraud".
OL,16,FHe said his force had received about
OL,17,F14,000 reports of online shopping fraud
OL,18,Fin the last 12 months - equating to
OL,19,F#1,278 in loss per victim.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
