OL,3,GNEWSAShoppers warned to stay vigilant
OL,4,Aon Black Friday
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Devon for BBC
OL,7,FScam Safe Week, he warned: "It comes
OL,8,Fback to the age-old adage - if it looks
OL,9,Ftoo good to be true, it is."
